raise_parameter.fl:
  before Simplify (11 steps): returns [0: <fun>; <fun>]
  after Simplify (7 steps): returns [0: <fun>; <fun>]
  the check of kinds: passes before, passes after
  the check of static names: passes before, passes after
  calls outside code: 0 before, 0 after
  the same
  calls outside code once those of known code are inlined: 0
  not validated
  related once lifted: the same once values are lifted to symbols without the liftings' symbols-and-constants-only exit test, the terms normalised and unused value slots removed
  (in the model, an exit before is matched by one after under the restricted observer class; exit values may differ)
  the check of regions: passes before, passes after
  the ends of regions (the model's ends_check, on a certificate that the tool guesses): accepted before, accepted after; with its option eo_own_end: accepted before, accepted after
